invalid type: string "Push Tags\n\nbash\ngit push origin tags\n\n\n\n\n14. Git Ignore\n\nCreate .gitignore\n\nExample:\n\nbash\n__pycache__/\n.env\nvenv/\nnode_modules/\n\n\nUsed to ignore unnecessary files.\n\n\n\n15. GitHub SSH Commands\n\nGenerate SSH Key\n\nbash\nsshkeygen t ed25519 C \"your@email.com\"\n\n\n\n\nStart SSH Agent\n\nbash\neval \"$(sshagent s)\"\n\n\n\n\nAdd SSH Key\n\nbash\nnÿÿÿ